 "notes": [
  "Day show: open 11:00, start 12:00 on 2025-04-06 at Hiroshima International Conference Center Phoenix Hall; Part 2 (STU48 × NMB48, 17:30) is a different show. NGT48 did not appear.",
  "Song order locked from five agreeing sources (official X ALT text, Pia/Music Culture official report, 48pedia, King Records 30-track playlist, fan blog). 30 songs; no encore.",
  "Structure: HKT48 block (13) → unit collabs (3) → STU48 block (11) → joint songs (3, last = Yume Chikara).",
  "Overture marks H00/S00 come from one fan blog only: PROV.",
  "MC positions: HKT after H03 and H08; STU after S03, S07 and (PROV) S10; joint MC after J02. dur_s are rough guesses; no grade anchor.",
  "Official cast changed once: Okamura Rio out (injury), Kurushima Yuka and Morokuzu Noa in (STU48 notice 2025-03-31). The hkt48.jp schedule page still shows the old list.",
  "Blueberry Pie unit: Ryuto, Eura, Shibui + Takao, Ozaki. 48pedia and one blog wrongly list Kurihara Sae."
 ],
